{"id":"ep0p7txi2jggrsr4shlquksfq","title":"你应当尝试 Gleam","originalTitle":"You should try Gleam","summary":"Gleam 是一种面向 BEAM 虚拟机的函数式编程语言，语法简洁且与 Erlang 和 Elixir 兼容。它还能编译为 JavaScript 并通过 Node.js 运行。Gleam 的类型安全和尾递归优化使其在处理复杂数据时更高效，适合构建可扩展的系统。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://nchagnet.eu/blog/you-should-try-gleam"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T03:33:27.517Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:37.116Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:37.116Z","category":"languages-runtime","tags":["新项目","教程与观点","GitHub"],"score":39,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"a02d58f2-887b-4788-bbd2-ff5d1ed98696","title":"Gleam语言发布：兼容Erlang/Elixir并支持JS编译"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"a02d58f2-887b-4788-bbd2-ff5d1ed98696","title":"Gleam语言发布：兼容Erlang/Elixir并支持JS编译"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fcmN5ro7Tt68","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}